{"id":"n65171-6-3","stage":2,"title":"썩다 · 差","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n65171-6-3-1","ko":"무슨 일이야? 얼굴이 썩었네.","zh":"怎么了？脸色看起来好差啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么。","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"1","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}},{"text":"일이야?","meaning":"事情","explanation":"일：事情；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"6","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일이야","audio":"/audio/07685cceee2c1aebca4e.mp3"}},{"text":"얼굴이","meaning":"脸色","explanation":"얼굴：脸色；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"얼굴","audio":"/audio/886ae927b512e2e4bc7b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17183","senseId":"3","lemma":"얼굴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼굴이","audio":"/audio/81669bb10178aa2a65c6.mp3"}},{"text":"썩었네.","meaning":"差","explanation":"썩다：差；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"썩다","audio":"/audio/b0d5a487db4674cfe726.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65171","senseId":"6","lemma":"썩다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"썩었네","audio":"/audio/d7848eb008add0e422f5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"用于询问不确定或不知道的事情、对象、东西等。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"所处的情形或状况。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"886ae927b512e2e4","term":"얼굴","zh":"脸色","audio":"/audio/886ae927b512e2e4bc7b.mp3","entryId":"17183","definition":"某种心理状态表露于外的表情。","pronunciation":["얼굴"]},{"id":"b0d5a487db4674cf","term":"썩다","zh":"差","audio":"/audio/b0d5a487db4674cfe726.mp3","entryId":"65171","definition":"脸色变得暗沉无光泽。","pronunciation":["썩따"]}],"audio":"/audio/f6ec179e6dcf3ffb5e6e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n65171-6-3-2","ko":"한 달 내내 야근을 해서 그래.","zh":"因为整个月都在加班啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"한","meaning":"一（한 달：一个月；내내：整整、一直）","explanation":"한：一（한 달：一个月；내내：整整、一直）。","readings":[{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73278","senseId":"1","lemma":"한","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}},{"text":"달","meaning":"月","explanation":"달：月。","readings":[{"term":"달","audio":"/audio/2f941e6eb2150679c43f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62266","senseId":"2","lemma":"달","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"달","audio":"/audio/2f941e6eb2150679c43f.mp3"}},{"text":"내내","meaning":"始终，一直","explanation":"내내：始终，一直。","readings":[{"term":"내내","audio":"/audio/c4bb20b6c91a2fcfba30.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60627","senseId":"1","lemma":"내내","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내내","audio":"/audio/c4bb20b6c91a2fcfba30.mp3"}},{"text":"야근을","meaning":"加班","explanation":"야근：加班；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"야근","audio":"/audio/e8aeeb6fc5aa42e226b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"90303","senseId":"1","lemma":"야근","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"야근을","audio":"/audio/0b51441a9a56ccb1685f.mp3"}},{"text":"해서","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해서","audio":"/audio/91cbeb2e0a1193dc2da9.mp3"}},{"text":"그래.","meaning":"那样，就那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样，就那样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"4","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"89233692031a62c6","term":"한","zh":"一（한 달：一个月；내내：整整、一直）","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3","entryId":"73278","definition":"一（한 달：一个月；내내：整整、一直）","pronunciation":["한"]},{"id":"2f941e6eb2150679","term":"달","zh":"月","audio":"/audio/2f941e6eb2150679c43f.mp3","entryId":"62266","definition":"把一年分为十二个的每个时间段。","pronunciation":["달"]},{"id":"c4bb20b6c91a2fcf","term":"내내","zh":"始终，一直","audio":"/audio/c4bb20b6c91a2fcfba30.mp3","entryId":"60627","definition":"从开始到最后持续着。","pronunciation":["내ː내"]},{"id":"e8aeeb6fc5aa42e2","term":"야근","zh":"加班","audio":"/audio/e8aeeb6fc5aa42e226b8.mp3","entryId":"90303","definition":"过了下班时间后工作到很晚。","pronunciation":["야ː근"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样，就那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"没有什么特别的变化。","pronunciation":["그러타"]}],"audio":"/audio/7035ce5e8c373d7f346a.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.33,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=65171","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"6","sourceLevel":"중급","day":71,"sequenceScore":1.9276,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["因为整个月都在加班啊。","妈妈，我穿这件衣服怎么样？","怎么了？脸色看起来好差啊。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["因为整个月都在加班啊。","怎么了？脸色看起来好差啊。","妈妈，我穿这件衣服怎么样？"],"answer":0}]}
